   "title": "Spelling: adding -ing and -ed",
   "minutes": 12,
   "programRef": "MINEDUB primary school curriculum (English-speaking subsystem), Level II (Class 3) — English Language; to be checked against the official texts",
   "status": "draft",
   "author": "CastBridge (AI draft)",
   "source": "Original writing following the Cameroonian curriculum; to be reviewed by a teacher",
   "objectives": [
    "Add -ing and -ed to verbs.",
    "Know the doubling and dropping e rules."
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
